    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Build, Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a place teeming with mysterious creatures lurking in the shadows. This is no ordinary survival challenge; this is a fight for your life against nature, monsters, and your own limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival at Its Core</strong>: Scavenge for resources, craft tools, and fight to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Sanctuary</strong>: Construct a base to protect yourself from the dangers that roam the island at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Living World</strong>: Discover hidden caves, ancient ruins, and other survivors as you piece together the island\u2019s grim story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Unknown</strong>: Encounter towering monstrosities that hunt you relentlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Your Escape</strong>: Unravel the island's secrets and uncover your path to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive the and escape this island of nightmares?</p>",
